      "text": "Bored without a case, Holmes is using cocaine, to Watson's dismay. Holmes shows off his methods by deducing Watson's trip to the post office and the sad history of Watson's elder brother from an old watch. Then a young woman, Mary Morstan, arrives to consult him."
    },
