      "id": "sof.recap.ch2",
      "from": "ch2.para40",
      "evidence": [
        "ch2.para11",
        "ch2.para17",
        "ch2.para20",
        "ch2.para24",
        "ch2.para40"
      ],
      "text": "Mary Morstan's father vanished in London in 1878. Since 1882 someone has sent her a pearl every year, and today a letter summoned her to the Lyceum Theatre tonight. Holmes and Watson agree to go with her. Watson is captivated by her but thinks himself unworthy."
    }
